# `neighbor_structure = "AUTO"` and TOWERS (D[best-defaults]): `mdir check`
# states on a line of its own why AUTO took TOWERS or not. Each input that
# the rule keeps on the structures of D261 names its reason, which comes
# before the device is asked; without a visible device the rule stops at
# the device. The structure of D261 and its reason are those of before.
# A structure that was given is not ruled on.
#
